{"id":"atlas-intro","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":3600,"height":200,"text":"**Settings and developer / NOS · 1.43-B**\n\n13 system members · 23 one-hop ghost neighbours · 37 canonical edges\nEvery incoming and outgoing edge of a member is shown, including parallel edges. Ghost cards retain status text and gap badges; grey borders mark neighbours unless a high/critical gap requires red. Arrows retain source direction; MISSING means an absent connection, not working data flow.\nCyan data · orange control · green persist · purple schedule · yellow UI · red event.\n[[NOS System Map.canvas|Return to overview]]","color":"5"},
{"id":"drv-hal-store","type":"text","x":1872,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**hal_store (NVS + SD routing)**\nBlob API over NVS namespace 'wos'. Only…\n\nruns: Called inline by the owner of each key (UI task or board-fs).\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|10 gaps]]\n[[Storage and persistence|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"drv-display-te","type":"text","x":2328,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Display TE wait (no TE on B)**\nTearing-effect synchronisation helper. B…\n\nruns: Never active on B.\n\n`STUB`\n[[Rendering pipeline|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"drv-radio-admission","type":"text","x":2784,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Radio admission control**\nStarts or stops Wi-Fi and BLE from the saved…\n\nruns: Main loop, every pass (also with the screen off).\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Connectivity and voice|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"drv-ext-hal","type":"text","x":3240,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Strap HAL contract and presence mask**\nhal_ext_* contract shared by all strap…\n\nruns: Serviced by the ext task, wakes at most every 50 ms.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|9 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"eng-frame-pacer","type":"text","x":2100,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Frame pacer**\nWaits on the pace-timer semaphore to hold…\n\nruns: UI task, once per ON frame.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Engine and scheduling|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"eng-prefs-poll","type":"text","x":2556,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Live pref application**\nMain-loop code that applies nos_prefs…\n\nruns: UI task, every loop pass including screen off.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Settings and developer|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"eng-settings-shutter","type":"text","x":3012,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Settings shutter blur helper**\nBlur helper used for the Settings list…\n\nruns: UI task while Settings opens.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Shell and faces|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-activity","type":"text","x":48,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Activity service (svc_activity)**\nTurns pedometer output into daily steps, km,…\n\nruns: act_tick 1 Hz on the UI task, also screen off. Checkpoint every 10 min when dirty.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|14 gaps]]\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-power-policy","type":"text","x":504,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Power policy**\nDecides the idle target (SENSOR by default,…\n\nruns: UI task each loop pass.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Power and battery|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-pedometer","type":"text","x":960,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Pedometer and walk detector**\nCounts steps from the 3 Hz-filtered IMU with…\n\nruns: board-sense every 20 ms; calendar day re-checked at most 1 Hz.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-tuning","type":"text","x":1416,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Gesture tuning**\nWalk and knock thresholds (sportstune, 20 B)…\n\nruns: Read on every IMU sample.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Settings and developer|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"svc-phone-time","type":"text","x":1872,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Phone time and timezone sync**\nApplies setTime epoch and E.setTimeZone from…\n\nruns: On message, in phone_tick.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Followup 1 - Time source, RTC trust and midnight rollover end to end|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-prefs","type":"text","x":2328,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Preferences service (nos_prefs)**\nOwns the 52 B nos_prefs struct, defaults,…\n\nruns: prefs_tick on the UI task, only when the persistence window is open.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Settings and developer|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"svc-sd-xfer","type":"text","x":2784,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**SD transfer service (SDXFER v=2)**\nEight transfer verbs over USB or BLE to…\n\nruns: Executed on the cmd task, any display state.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Followup 5 - USB command to handler map and host protocol edge cases|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-time","type":"text","x":3240,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**System clock and timezone (hal)**\nOwns time(), TZ from prefs, setters used by…\n\nruns: Library code; frame-latched datetime for the UI.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|4 gaps]]\n[[Followup 1 - Time source, RTC trust and midnight rollover end to end|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
